---
config:
  theme: base
  themeVariables:
    fontFamily: Excalifont
  flowchart:
    wrappingWidth: 640
    padding: 18
    nodeSpacing: 44
    rankSpacing: 40
---
flowchart TD
    accTitle: prepare_data — import sources or prepare an observation panel
    accDescr: The source is uploaded files, pinned raw data or one replicate of an applied simulation; a source that cannot be read fails the call. With a current model, the check groups from edit_model re-run where their inputs changed, and the raw data or observation panel commits with their reports; partial extraction and failed checks are saved as warnings.

    request(["prepare_data<br/>source: files · raw_data · simulation"])
    source{"Source?"}
    error["Fails · nothing saved<br/>files: no usable upload<br/>raw_data: unknown pins, a model<br/>without measurements, or no rows<br/>simulation: not an applied<br/>simulation, or no such replicate"]
    files["Import the newest upload<br/>an ingestion agent writes<br/>a raw-data table"]
    raw["Extract and encode observations<br/>pinned raw data · pinned model's measurements<br/>agents read semantic indicators<br/>max_windows keeps the newest windows"]
    sim["Materialize one simulated replicate<br/>its observations only<br/>no latent paths or parameters"]
    model{"Current<br/>model?"}
    checks["Checks as in edit_model<br/>groups whose inputs changed re-run<br/>data profile · compatibility · fit preflight · predictive"]
    commit(["Commit raw data or observation panel<br/>+ check reports + logs"])
    messages["Saved with messages<br/>warning: partial extraction · each failed check group<br/>info: checks not evaluated"]

    request --> source
    source -. fails .-> error
    source -->|files| files
    source -->|raw_data| raw
    source -->|simulation| sim
    files --> model
    raw --> model
    sim --> model
    model -->|yes| checks --> commit
    model -->|no| commit
    messages -.- commit

    classDef action fill:#9333ea,stroke:#9333ea,color:#ffffff
    classDef decision fill:#f1f5f9,stroke:#64748b,color:#0f172a
    classDef error fill:#fff1f2,stroke:#b91c1c,color:#7f1d1d
    classDef messages fill:#fffbeb,stroke:#b45309,color:#451a03
    classDef commit fill:#ecfdf5,stroke:#047857,color:#064e3b
    classDef check fill:#f8fafc,stroke:#334155,color:#0f172a
    class request action
    class source,model decision
    class error error
    class messages messages
    class commit commit
    class checks check
